OL,3,GNEWSAHospice offers 'vital' help to
OL,4,Agrieving children
OL,5,
OL,6,FDarcy was 15 when her mum died at Saint
OL,7,FMichael's Hospice in Harrogate.
OL,9,FFor a young girl, working through her
OL,10,FGCSE exams, it was a painful
OL,11,Fexperience.
OL,13,F"She had cancer when I was three years
OL,14,Fold," she says.
OL,16,F"It returned in 2022. I thought she
OL,17,Fwould live until I was 18 - that was
OL,18,Fthe point she always said she would get
OL,19,Fme to - but in summer 2024 she became
OL,20,Fquite ill and that's when I knew she
OL,21,Fwas going to die."
